{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25916","headline":"荐冰 · 赵蕃","name":"荐冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仲月开凌室，斋心感圣情。\n寒姿分玉坐，皓彩发丹楹。\n积素因风壮，虚空向日明。\n遥涵牕户冷，近映冕旒清。\n在掌光逾澈，当轩质自轻。\n良辰方可致，由此表精诚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵蕃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}